 equals night checkmate so this was  probably my nicest combination against  the world champion  magnus carlson um and uh yeah so i hope  that you enjoyed this little tidbit i  once again will be doing a lot more  videos on  my interesting games against magnus some  will be more deeply analyzed  so i hope that you've enjoyed this  little exposition  and uh i'll be uploading more videos on  my lessons with charlie and on more  game segments and more instructional  videos all of that is coming  your way very soon so thank you very  much for watching and  hope to hear from you in the comments  section thank you
 

